meta {
  name: Media Files Sort Order
  type: http
  seq: 5
}

patch {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/{{table}}/{{recordId}}/files/sort-order
  body: json
  auth: inherit
}

headers {
  Content-Type: application/json
  Accept-Language: oz
}

body:json {
  {
    "order": [2, 1, 3]
  }
}

docs {
  Yozuv ichidagi FAYLLARNI qayta tartiblash.

  DIQQAT: bu yerda kalit `order` (massiv - fayl ID'lari yangi tartibda).
  Yozuvlarni tartiblash uchun 12-Common dagi `sort_order` kalitli so'rov ishlatiladi.
}
